#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigCommon.cpp:100
msgid ""
"The first layer will be shrunk in the XY plane by the configured value to "
"compensate for the 1st layer squish aka an Elephant Foot effect."
msgstr ""
